OL,3,ACivil servant who secretly held five
OL,4,Ajobs found guilty of fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter seven hours of deliberation, the
OL,7,Fjury unanimously found Chowdhury guilty
OL,8,Fof eight counts of fraud by false
OL,9,Frepresentation and one count of fraud
OL,10,Fby a failure to disclose.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
