OL,3,AFrance accuses Iran of supermarket
OL,4,Afridge hacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrance has accused Iran's Islamic
OL,7,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) of
OL,8,Fbeing behind cyber-attacks that raised
OL,9,Fthe temperatures of supermarket fridges
OL,10,Fand freezers across the country last
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FForeign Minister Jean-Noel Barrot said
OL,14,Fthe attack was "unprecedented in both
OL,15,Fits scale and its level of aggression",
OL,16,Fadding those who were responsible would
OL,17,Fbe hit with sanctions.
OL,19,FIran has yet to respond officially, but
OL,20,Fsome Iranian media outlets have
OL,21,Fdismissed the allegations as baseless.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
