OL,3,AFrance accuses Iran of supermarket
OL,4,Afridge hacking
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe French hacking, which led to the
OL,7,Fdestruction of tons of frozen and
OL,8,Fchilled food in France was followed by
OL,9,Fa similar attack against supermarkets
OL,10,Facross several other European
OL,11,Fcountries. It is not known if the
OL,12,Finstances are linked.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
